Weather data: Deutscher Wetterdienst (DWD), open data under the German
GeoNutzungsverordnung (GeoNutzV). Attribution: "Datenbasis: Deutscher
Wetterdienst". The MOSMIX forecasts, the hourly observations, the warnings,
the pollen and UV indices and the radar composite are published unchanged
or converted in units; the warning titles are translated by this
integration.

Air quality: Umweltbundesamt (UBA), air data of the measuring networks of
the Länder and of the UBA, Datenlizenz Deutschland – Namensnennung – Version
2.0 (https://www.govdata.de/dl-de/by-2-0). Attribution: "Quelle:
Umweltbundesamt, Luftdaten der Messnetze der Länder und des UBA". The index
and the concentrations are published unchanged; the advice of the levels is
the Umweltbundesamt's, shortened and translated.

Country borders of the radar image: GeoBasis-DE / BKG (Bundesamt für
Kartographie und Geodäsie), served by the DWD GeoServer.

This integration is not affiliated with nor endorsed by the Deutscher
Wetterdienst nor by the Umweltbundesamt. It never uses their logos.
